{"id":"n2-028","title":"Noun の ことだから","romaji":"Noun no koto dakara","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Used to provide a reason or explanation based on one's knowledge about the noun; 'since', 'because', 'knowing'.","longExplanation":"The の ことだから (no koto dakara) grammar point is used when giving a reason or explanation based on one’s knowledge or understanding of a particular person or thing. It often implies 'given that this is the kind of person/thing it is'.","formation":"Noun + のことだから","examples":[{"jp":"料理が得意な彼のことだから、美味しい料理を作ってくれるでしょう。","romaji":"Ryouri ga tokui na kare no koto dakara, oishii ryouri wo tsukutte kureru deshou.","en":"Since he’s good at cooking, he’ll probably make delicious food.","words":[{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"得意","vocabId":"1454510","reading":"とくい"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しい","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい"},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作っ","vocabId":"1597890","reading":"つくる","baseForm":"作る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"くれる","vocabId":"1514960","reading":"くれる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7,8]},{"jp":"いつも遅刻する彼女のことだから、今日も遅れるかもしれない。","romaji":"Itsumo chikoku suru kanojo no koto dakara, kyou mo okureru kamoshirenai.","en":"Because she’s always late, she might be late again today.","words":[{"surface":"いつも","vocabId":"1188890","reading":"いつも"},{"surface":"遅刻","vocabId":"1422050","reading":"ちこく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"今日","vocabId":"1579110","reading":"きょう"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅れる","vocabId":"1589040","reading":"おくれる"},{"surface":"かも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しれ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"しれる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"安い店のことだから、たくさん売れるはずだ。","romaji":"Yasui mise no koto dakara, takusan ureru hazu da.","en":"Since it’s a cheap store, it should sell a lot.","words":[{"surface":"安い","vocabId":"1153670","reading":"やすい"},{"surface":"店","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"たくさん","vocabId":"1415870","reading":"たくさん"},{"surface":"売れる","vocabId":"1473960","reading":"うれる"},{"surface":"はず","vocabId":"1476430","reading":"はず"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"ドラマ好きな彼のことだから、最新のドラマについて話すといいでしょう。","romaji":"Dorama suki na kare no koto dakara, saishin no dorama ni tsuite hanasu to ii deshou.","en":"Knowing he likes dramas, it’d be good to talk about the latest shows.","words":[{"surface":"ドラマ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"好き","vocabId":"1277450","reading":"すき"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"最新","vocabId":"1294090","reading":"さいしん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ドラマ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"について","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話す","vocabId":"1562350","reading":"はなす"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いい","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"いう"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7]}]}